def main : Int := [boolrec Int 100 200 [int-lt 3 5]]

;; PReduce-lite Phase 5 (Bool eliminator): boolrec dispatches on the
;; scrutinee. (int-lt 3 5) reduces to true; boolrec then returns the
;; true-case (100). Validates iota-rule firing: when scrutinee resolves
;; to a known constructor, the matching arm's compiled body is bridged
;; to the result via identity propagator.
;; nf-equivalent: (expr-int 100)
;; :expect-exit 100
